# Meeple, fallen: the giant chanterelle meeple (meeple) knocked over onto its back, lying 2.65 m long with its feet towards +z,
# its eyes floating above its face and looking at the sky. It rests on its heels and on the brim of its hat, which stands proud of
# its back, so its head is lifted a little.
format 1
collider mesh

Translate translation=(0, 0.43, 1.3)
    # Laid on its back (a quarter turn about x brings its front, +z, up), a little less so it lies on its hat brim and its heels
    Rotate rotation=(-1.516, 0, 0)
        Part part=meeple
